两个终端市场的系统架构、客户决策链及元器件选型流程","ClassificationOne":"销售","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-04T12:32:37","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"30f03df1-5361-4ce0-91d8-4553f53c7866","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561280846,"PostDateInt":1785737401000,"PostDate":"2026-08-03T14:10:01","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"大客户经理","OrgId":2912488,"Org":"MXG","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["四川省·成都市","江苏省·无锡市","上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 大客户战略深耕与业务关系建设：跟踪通信新基建、数据中心、芯片国产化等行业趋势，结合客户战略布局与技术路线，精准拆解业务痛点与技术瓶颈，重点深耕基站和数据中心等核心场景，全面负责大客户业务关系建设，建立长期战略合作共赢机制，持续拓展深度合作场景，提升大客户合作份额与战略绑定深度。\n2. 芯片与资源需求锁定：常态化对接客户技术、采购、项目核心团队，精准抓取目标芯片（射频/数通/电源等）规格参数、性能指标、量产规模及迭代节奏；同步收集Fab产能、工艺节点配套时间表与规划，形成标准化需求台账。\n3. 内部立项推动与方案落地：基于客户真实需求，联动研发、产品、供应链团队，输出技术适配与资源匹配方案；主导Design Win立项推进，协调内部资源保障样品交付、测试验证及批量适配。\n4.  技术产品持续迭代优化：跟进客户项目全周期，基于基站/算力场景实测反馈，推动公司芯片及配套方案的版本升级，形成“需求-交付-迭代”闭环。\n5. 项目全周期管控与商务闭环：负责资源规划、技术对接至产品落地全流程，主导商务谈判与价格策略，协调解决技术卡点、资源缺口、交期异常等问题，保障量产供应安全，完成年度指标。","Require":"任职要求\n1. 专业背景：本科及以上学历，通信工程、微波、电子信息、微电子等相关专业，具备扎实的通信系统或半导体芯片理论基础。\n2. 行业经验：8年以上半导体或相关领域经验，熟悉基站射频、算力基建芯片的技术规格与应用逻辑，有头部设备商资源或Fab配套合作经验者优先。\n3. 核心能力：能听懂“研发语言”，具备独立对接技术端需求、识别痛点的能力；熟悉芯片选型、认证及量产导入全流程，具备操盘6-18个月长周期复杂项目的经验。\n4. 素质要求：逻辑清晰，具备敏锐的行业趋势判断力与极强的跨部门资源整合力，抗压性强，适应头部客户高标准保密与合作模式。\n优先条件：有通信设备/数据中心头部厂商服务经验，或成功主导过射频/数通/电源芯片项目落地及资源配套案例者优先。","ClassificationOne":"市场","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"8年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-03T14:10:01","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"81faa9b9-3b86-4c88-966d-c4d50909baeb","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561280829,"PostDateInt":1785736710000,"PostDate":"2026-08-03T13:58:30","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"技术专家-高功率芯片设计","OrgId":3254202,"Org":"卫星/激光通讯","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·无锡市","上海市","四川省·成都市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"一、岗位定位\n作为射频高功率芯片研发核心技术骨干，主导大功率放大器方向业务，攻克行业重难点，统筹核心项目架构迭代、技术路线规划，搭建高功率产品技术体系，赋能产品性能升级与量产落地，支撑高功率核心产品迭代落地。","Require":"一、硬性准入条件\n要求电磁场与微波技术、微电子、电路与系统等相关专业博士。\n二、核心能力\n顶层架构与方案攻坚能力：精通GaN、GaAs、RF-LDMOS等主流高功率芯片工艺，深耕大功率PA、Doherty高效率PA、高功率驱动、功率合成、高效散热匹配等核心技术，具备高功率芯片整体架构设计、方案选型、技术难点预判与攻坚能力，可独立定义产品技术方案、攻克高功率效率、线性度、散热、可靠性等核心行业难题。\n技术统筹与迭代引领能力：具备高功率射频产品技术路线规划、技术沉淀、专利布局能力，可统筹多版本产品迭代、关键技术预研，梳理标准化高功率研发技术体系，同时承接重点项目技术评审、方案把关，规避核心技术风险。\n三、综合素质。\n技术视野开阔、逻辑思维缜密，具备极强的问题攻坚与复盘迭代能力；责任心极强、抗压能力突出，具备优秀的技术统筹、跨部门协同、技术输出能力，思维前瞻性强，可长期深耕高端高功率射频芯片研发领域。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"博士研究生","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-03T13:58:30","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":nul